# Bit Manipulation Notes

## 1. Count Set Bits

### Method 1: Right Shift

```java
int count = 0;

while(n != 0) {
    if((n & 1) == 1) {
        count++;
    }
    n = n >> 1;
}

return count;
```

### Method 2: Brian Kernighan's Algorithm

```java
int count = 0;

while(n != 0) {
    n = n & (n - 1);
    count++;
}

return count;
```

