# 4. Check Whether Number Has Exactly One Set Bit

Formula:

```java
(n & (n - 1)) == 0
```

Example:

```java
if(n <= 0 || (n & (n - 1)) != 0) {
    return -1;
}
```

---

# 5. Find Position of the Only Set Bit

```java
if(n <= 0 || (n & (n - 1)) != 0) {
    return -1;
}

int pos = 1;

while((n & 1) == 0) {
    pos++;
    n >>= 1;
}

return pos;
```

