# 9. Common Bit Operations

### Check ith Bit

```java
(n & (1 << i)) != 0
```

### Set ith Bit

```java
n | (1 << i)
```

### Clear ith Bit

```java
n & ~(1 << i)
```

### Toggle ith Bit

```java
n ^ (1 << i)
```

